{"3536480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The AC130 slays the zombies.", "steam_appid": 3536480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a zombie shooting game featuring single-player or multiplayer cooperation. Players can become an AC130 fire control officer to cover ground teammates or join a ground tactical squad to eliminate zombies and survive! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Introduction </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Become an AC130 fire control officer, using 20mm, 40mm, and 105mm shells of different types to provide fire support for ground tactical squads from high altitude, covering ground teammates and ensuring safe evacuation! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Join a ground tactical squad, search for firearms, eliminate zombies, and wait for the evacuation helicopter to arrive under AC130's fire cover to complete the evacuation! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1. Evacuation Mode (Multiplayer Co-op): The AC130 fire control officer provides air fire support while the ground tactical squad holds their position and waits for the evacuation helicopter to arrive and complete the evacuation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Endless Survival Mode (Multiplayer Co-op): The AC130 fire control officer provides air fire support, and the ground tactical squad survives endless waves of zombies for as long as possible with no evacuation helicopter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  Multiplayer Cooperation </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends or strangers to cooperate in eliminating zombies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Firearms and Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1. AC130: 20mm, 40mm, 105mm cannons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infrared night vision system, full-color imaging system </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Ground tactical squad: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 4 types of assault rifles </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1 type of precision marksman rifle </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 type of pistol </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1 type of shotgun </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1 type of submachine gun </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1 type of general-purpose machine gun </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Grenades and Claymore mines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a zombie shooting game featuring single-player or multiplayer cooperation. Players can become an AC130 fire control officer to cover ground teammates or join a ground tactical squad to eliminate zombies and survive! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Introduction </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Become an AC130 fire control officer, using 20mm, 40mm, and 105mm shells of different types to provide fire support for ground tactical squads from high altitude, covering ground teammates and ensuring safe evacuation! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Join a ground tactical squad, search for firearms, eliminate zombies, and wait for the evacuation helicopter to arrive under AC130's fire cover to complete the evacuation! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1. Evacuation Mode (Multiplayer Co-op): The AC130 fire control officer provides air fire support while the ground tactical squad holds their position and waits for the evacuation helicopter to arrive and complete the evacuation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Endless Survival Mode (Multiplayer Co-op): The AC130 fire control officer provides air fire support, and the ground tactical squad survives endless waves of zombies for as long as possible with no evacuation helicopter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  Multiplayer Cooperation </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends or strangers to cooperate in eliminating zombies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Firearms and Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1. AC130: 20mm, 40mm, 105mm cannons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infrared night vision system, full-color imaging system </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Ground tactical squad: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 4 types of assault rifles </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1 type of precision marksman rifle </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 type of pistol </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1 type of shotgun </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1 type of submachine gun </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1 type of general-purpose machine gun </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Grenades and Claymore mines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "short_description": "In the doomsday world of zombies, a tactical team searching for survivors is surrounded by countless zombies and is in a very critical situation. The command center urgently dispatches an AC130 to provide fire cover and assist in the evacuation.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese, English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536480/672d0783569ed7fb679773c718cea9753ebacb1d/header.jpg?t=1784169522", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536480/c1669eeb47100fd1b4f52e07585c6f4d54fcce07/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784169522", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536480/c1669eeb47100fd1b4f52e07585c6f4d54fcce07/caps